   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "The outermost operation is a quotient with numerator \\( \\sin^{2}(3x) \\) and denominator \\( 2^{x} \\), so the quotient rule comes first (equivalently, rewrite \\( f \\) as a product with the factor \\( 2^{-x} \\)).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Divide",
